+| 0087 | 2026-10-12 | Device tests T4.7, T4.9 and T6: **every list of notes and coins now uses the squares layout** (the note or coin with an x3 badge) instead of the old "1 × $2" text. Cancelling a part-paid cash sale (collect the change back, return what was handed over), the Check change answer (**Ask for**, **They keep**, **Give as change**), the cash screen's "Ask for less" option, and the daily float report (**Take out**, **Leave in the drawer**, **Top up**, the notes better banked) all use it. One shared component, `src/ui/CountSquares.tsx`; `adviceFor` now also returns `groups` and `note` for the screen | B1i, B1d, B1f |
 
